BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market - Every Saturday from 8am - 1pm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T050000
UID:10001851-1794038400-1794056400@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience the heart and soul of Davis every Saturday at the 
 Davis Farmers Market in Central Park! \n🗓 Every Saturday⏰ 8:00 AM 
 – 1:00 PM📍 Central Park\, Davis \nShop fresh from the source with lo
 cal farmers and vendors offering: \n🥕 Fresh\, seasonal produce🌻 Farm
  products🛍 Handmade crafts🥖 Fresh-baked goods☕ Coffee and hot food
  \nWhether you’re stocking up on locally grown ingredients\, enjoying br
 eakfast in the park\, or simply soaking in the vibrant community atmospher
 e\, the Davis Farmers Market is a beloved weekly tradition for all ages. \
 nBring your family\, support local growers and makers\, and enjoy the boun
 ty of our fertile region every Saturday!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-every-saturday-fr
 om-8am-1pm/2026-11-07/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Davis Odd Fellows Classic Film Fest: The Producers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T130000
UID:10002212-1794162600-1794171600@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The laughs continue at the Davis Odd Fellows Classic Film Fest
  with a screening of Mel Brooks’ comedy classic The Producers (1968)! \n
 Starring Zero Mostel and Gene Wilder\, this outrageous comedy follows a sc
 heming theater producer and a mild-mannered accountant who hatch a plan to
  make a fortune from a Broadway flop. Naturally\, things don’t go quite 
 as planned! \nDavis Enterprise film critic Derrick Bang will share fascina
 ting film trivia and behind-the-scenes insights before the screening\, fol
 lowed by a Q&A afterward. Live music by According to Bazooka will kick off
  the evening. \nAdmission and popcorn are FREE! Donations are welcome\, an
 d beverages will be available for purchase at the bar. \nDoors open at 6:2
 9 PM\, and the movie starts at 7:01 PM. Bring a friend and enjoy a classic
  night at the movies!
LOCATION:Davis Odd Fellows\, 415 2nd St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United Sta
 tes
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-odd-fellows-classic-film-fest-th
 e-producers/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market – Wednesday Evenings (50th Anniversary Year
 )
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T180000
UID:10002136-1794409200-1794420000@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The Davis Farmers Market continues every Wednesday in Central 
 Park with new fall hours! \nBeginning Wednesday\, September 2\, the Wednes
 day market will be open from 3:00–6:00 PM\, replacing the extended 4:00
 –8:00 PM Picnic in the Park hours. \nStop by to shop for fresh\, locally
  grown produce\, artisan goods\, prepared foods and other market favorites
  from local farmers and vendors. It’s a great opportunity to stock up fo
 r the week\, meet up with friends\, support local growers and food makers\
 , and enjoy a beautiful afternoon in Central Park. \nThe Davis Farmers Mar
 ket is celebrating its 50th Anniversary in 2026\, marking five decades of 
 bringing fresh food\, local farmers and the Davis community together. \nWe
 dnesday Market Details: \n\nWednesdays from 3:00–6:00 PM\nCentral Park i
 n Downtown Davis\nFresh\, seasonal produce\nArtisan goods and prepared foo
 ds\nLocal farmers and food makers\nFamily-friendly and open to everyone\n\
 nFree to attend – shop local and enjoy your Wednesday afternoon at the D
 avis Farmers Market!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-
 local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-11-11/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Davis Downtown Board Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T010000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T020000
UID:10000021-1794474000-1794477600@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the second Thursday of each month for our Governing
  Board of Directors meeting. The meeting is open to all interested. Stay u
 p-to-date on business and initiatives related to downtown Davis\, and the 
 opportunity to provide public comment will be available. \nMeetings are cu
 rrently held virtually on the Zoom platform from 9:00am to 10:00am. If you
  are interested in attending\, please contact us at info@davisdowntown.com
  to request a Zoom meeting invitation. \nTo view\, download and/or print B
 oard of Directors meeting agendas or minutes\, click on the following link
 : https://davisdowntown.com/agendas-meeting-information. \nMeeting locatio
 ns and times are subject to change.
LOCATION:Davis Downtown Board Meeting\, Zoom\, Davis\, CA
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-downtown-board-meeting/2026-11-1
 2/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout – Monthly Downtown Davis Art Walk (Free!)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T130000
UID:10000177-1794589200-1794603600@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Davis’s beloved 2nd Friday ArtAbout – a free monthly 
 self-guided artwalk coordinated by the Pence Gallery! Every second Friday\
 , stroll downtown Davis to discover fresh exhibits\, opening receptions\, 
 live music\, hands-on activities\, and direct chats with local and regiona
 l artists at 10+ galleries\, co-ops\, and businesses. \nSupport our vibran
 t arts scene\, uncover unique talent and styles\, and soak up the lively e
 nergy – ideal for friends\, families\, dates\, or solo adventures. Many 
 venues offer complimentary refreshments like wine and snacks. \nFree – n
 o tickets required! \n\nRuns approximately 5:00–9:00 PM (venue reception
 s vary—check the monthly guide for specifics).\nGrab the printed guide (
 with map & details) the week of at the Pence Gallery or participating spot
 s\, or download it at pencegallery.org/events/artabout/.\n\nInterested in 
 hosting as a venue\, artist\, or business? Visit https://pencegallery.org/
 events/artabout/ to fill out the corresponding forms. Please submit event
 s 3 weeks in advance via the form on the site to be included in the guide 
 and promotions. \nStay in the loop: facebook.com/davisartabout \nCome cele
 brate local creativity downtown – see you on the next second Friday! 
 🎨✨
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/2nd-friday-artabout-2/2026-11-13/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
